{"id": "Der5X6OSAOz", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Part 1/2 of Ravana x Mahadev Katha\nBefore he was Ravana, he was Dashagriv. His Pushpak stopped mid-air over a mountain, a monkey-faced gana told him to turn back, and he laughed. That laugh earned him a curse that would burn his Lanka years later 🔱\n\nTold as Ravanachhaya, Odisha's leather shadow theatre and the only puppet form in India named after Ravana himself. Every line is from the Valmiki Ramayana, Uttara Kanda 7.16.\n\nRavana x Mahadev, Katha 1, Part 1 of 2. Part 2: what one toe did to the man who lifted Kailash, and who that monkey really was 👀\n\nSend this to the friend who laughs first and thinks later 😅\n\n#dussehra #ravana #mahadev #ravanachhaya #shadowpuppet", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792434436, "like_count": 2666, "comment_count": 14, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2072216793405883a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 56.528, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMDc177RVEVLd9a3VbstSrAqFhD6gswH7GdltpvX9iJwy55tcV0eRss7I8e38pLxDEKvP-a1LtyQF9rC1ByDUXnUJhv6KSOIhhsWc4.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adp-sUZEM5mlbv73_j40Dr30dH0B6ZBHRFY3uF6lk0FjQ1FYJhjOpf9jJ3MCy5cdAb7YPcnWgg4bGlVxOkmhEAv5&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=NSPMGrLSDDcQ7kNvwHAyIuO&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xVwoLH4BwYzoyGBZZLCvdw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRV1xq_YMfbsuAnUqO3PbIj0Pn0_TdwZbtprnpEhJQMbA&oe=6AF4260F", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 56.528, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537